{"generated":"2026-11-16T19:22:18.227242+00:00","metadata":{"creator":"OASIS Message Queuing Telemetry Transport (MQTT) TC","date":"2026-11-16","description":"This specification defines the MQTT for Sensor Networks protocol (MQTT-SN). It is closely related to the MQTT v3.1.1 and MQTT v5.0 standards. MQTT-SN is optimized for implementation on low-cost, battery-operated devices with limited processing and storage resources. It is designed so that it will work over a variety of networking technologies and bridge to an MQTT network.","identifier":"https://docs.oasis-open.org/mqtt/mqtt-sn/v2.0/csd01/mqtt-sn-v2.0-csd01.md","language":"en","publisher":"OASIS Open","rights":"Copyright © OASIS Open 2026. All Rights Reserved. Provided under the Non-Assertion Mode of the OASIS IPR Policy (https://www.oasis-open.org/policies-guidelines/ipr/).","status":"DRAFT","subject":"MQTT, MQTT-SN, sensor networks, publish/subscribe, IoT, constrained devices","title":"MQTT for Sensor Networks Version 2.0","type":"Specification","version":"Committee Specification Draft 01"},"outputs":{"gfm-plus":{"bytes":455241,"hashes":[{"alg":"sha256","norm":"lf","value":"b736a48780eca77781b2ae5cb9dd35de76acbe0197b8bdf3e962313c3a312298"},{"alg":"blake3","norm":"lf","value":"80f14a3a5bb6cb88451f105c57cbafe63f5306fbd0c0cb665515d55c55e9ed33"}],"path":"build/gfm-plus.md"},"html":{"bytes":464810,"hashes":[{"alg":"sha256","norm":"lf","value":"d34bba4405da07e4947ebf61c113d4b4a1dde5d99ebdb456bdcd98e3581b0f2a"},{"alg":"blake3","norm":"lf","value":"eb119ff2807a1c8972bdf968c5faa1291f7487f21417e3ad378fc0144d00d405"}],"path":"build/html.md"},"mqtt-sn-typst.pdf":{"bytes":3791618,"hashes":[{"alg":"sha256","norm":"binary","value":"d3a4350761cb9521980b319580404637e6e3ae910d46d05cf0b4b3fc2efaf63c"},{"alg":"blake3","norm":"binary","value":"a25c6f0020b22c4dc8cb46c6b7b42549a3819d800a23cffd33384388f924aa2c"}],"path":"build/mqtt-sn-typst.pdf"},"typst":{"bytes":430845,"hashes":[{"alg":"sha256","norm":"lf","value":"3b145c4f64a9973